This license covers the skills in `skills/`, the agent in `agents/`, the
registry, and the installer.

Skills reached through `registry/skills.json` are NOT covered: they are fetched
at install time from their authors' repositories and remain under those
authors' own licenses.

THIRD-PARTY DERIVATIVE WORK

The following skills are derivatives of skills from
https://github.com/mattpocock/skills, MIT (c) 2026 Matt Pocock, used and
modified under those terms:

    skills/swift-tdd/               <- engineering/tdd
    skills/swift-diagnosing-bugs/   <- engineering/diagnosing-bugs
    skills/swift-code-review/       <- engineering/code-review
    skills/swift-domain-modeling/   <- engineering/domain-modeling
    skills/xcode-merge-conflicts/   <- engineering/resolving-merge-conflicts
    skills/apple-docs-research/     <- engineering/research
    skills/swift-pre-commit/        <- misc/setup-pre-commit

Each contains a NOTICE.md reproducing the upstream copyright and permission
notice as that license requires, and stating what was kept versus added. The
NOTICE ships inside each skill directory so it travels with any copy the
installer makes.

The remaining nine skills in skills/ are original work.
